WHY THIS LICENSE EXISTS
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is not open source, and it is not shared for public use. It is
a strictly personal and private portfolio that represents the author's own
identity, professional history, personal likeness, and body of work.

It is protected for the following reasons:

- PERSONAL IDENTITY & PRIVACY
  The Work contains the author's real name, likeness (photographs and
  imagery), professional history, credentials, and personal details. These
  are private and personal assets that must not be reproduced or reused
  elsewhere.

- AUTHENTICITY OF THE PORTFOLIO
  The Work is a live, publicly hosted portfolio. Unrestricted copying would
  allow others to reproduce the author's professional identity and work
  as their own, creating confusion, misrepresentation, and potential fraud.

- PROTECTION OF EFFORT & CRAFT
  The design, content, and engineering were created and refined by the
  author over many years. Allowing free reuse would effectively give away
  the author's professional output and reduce its value.

- PROTECTION AGAINST MISUSE
  Unrestricted redistribution could result in the Work being modified,
  misrepresented, or associated with content or purposes the author does
  not endorse or control.

